{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems","id":1139598,"title":"Playing Scion with non-Scion Systems","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-11T18:25:55-07:00","id":1139598,"title":"Playing Scion with non-Scion Systems","content":"A campaign I'm playing in will be wrapping up soon, and as is this group's tradition, someone else will be taking over as GM. Namely, me. My original intention was to run Scion 2E, but unless a backer PDF releases tomorrow, there won't be time for everyone to learn a new system before play will start.<br /> <br /> So, since 2E is off the table, but I've been prepping Scion storylines, I need to select a system that can work for a modern mythology game where the characters are all the children of gods/goddesses. Scion 1E has enough issues that I'm reluctant to go to that. I've been looking at Fate variants, but few of them seem to have enough moving pieces to satisfy a relatively mechanically savvy group.<br /> <br /> Does anyone have any suggestions for a system that would be suitable to play Scion, that isn't based off of the Scion rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T19:28:27-07:00","id":1139608,"title":"","content":"You mentioned Fate. Have you looked at the Superhero ruleset, Venture City?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T19:30:06-07:00","id":1139610,"title":"","content":"City of Mist is a PbtA game about mythic superheroes that would be very easy to reskin as Scion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T20:21:05-07:00","id":1139620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139608#post1139608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You mentioned Fate. Have you looked at the Superhero ruleset, Venture City?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have not, thanks for the suggestion. I'll take a look at it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139610#post1139610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">City of Mist is a PbtA game about mythic superheroes that would be very easy to reskin as Scion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, looks like the full version isn't yet available, but the starter set is free. I'll need to see if that's enough to actually run it - I'm not great at &quot;winging&quot; system rules.<br /> <br /> Thanks to both of you for the suggestions! (Still open to more though - more options is always better)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T22:00:30-07:00","id":1139632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HighPriest</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139620#post1139620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have not, thanks for the suggestion. I'll take a look at it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Hmm, looks like the full version isn't yet available, but the starter set is free. I'll need to see if that's enough to actually run it - I'm not great at &quot;winging&quot; system rules.<br /> <br /> Thanks to both of you for the suggestions! (Still open to more though - more options is always better)</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the full book isn't out yet, but the Starter set is free and custom characters are as simple as coming up with a Theme and associated Tags. Especially if you're familiar with how FATE works, it's essentially just using Aspects as stats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T22:56:13-07:00","id":1139641,"title":"","content":"There's the Cypher System. They even have a game setting featuring characters that grow in divinity. It's called Gods of the Fall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T23:46:33-07:00","id":1139652,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139641#post1139641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's the Cypher System. They even have a game setting featuring characters that grow in divinity. It's called Gods of the Fall.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are a few things I'm not fond of for in the Cypher System, namely how it handles experience and cyphers. That said, those are things I can houserule and I didn't consider using it. Thanks for the suggestion!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-12T13:43:45-07:00","id":1139761,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://wyrdwalkers.wikidot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> is a pretty blatantly scionesque game that uses Fate Core. I haven't dug too deep into it, but maybe it will help?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12989-center-of-all","name":"Center-of-All","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-12T14:13:41-07:00","id":1139769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139641#post1139641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's the Cypher System. They even have a game setting featuring characters that grow in divinity. It's called Gods of the Fall.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're welcome.<br /> <br /> There's also Part-Time Gods and it's Fate conversion from Third-Eye Games<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-12T17:30:57-07:00","id":1139793,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the delays!<br /> <br /> Part-time Gods or Godbound by Sine Nomine would be my suggestion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-12T21:41:29-07:00","id":1139827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Center-of-All</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139761#post1139761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://wyrdwalkers.wikidot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> is a pretty blatantly scionesque game that uses Fate Core. I haven't dug too deep into it, but maybe it will help?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Wasn't aware of that one at all. I'll definitely take a look - it doesn't look like a commercially available product, more like a homebrew?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139769#post1139769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're welcome.<br /> <br /> There's also Part-Time Gods and it's Fate conversion from Third-Eye Games<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks again! I'll take a look at these as well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139793#post1139793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the delays!<br /> <br /> Part-time Gods or Godbound by Sine Nomine would be my suggestion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the suggestion! I'm actually already running a Godbound game (using the Exalted setting) and it would be a decent choice but I was hoping to have a chance to run something different.<br /> <br /> For the record, I don't blame y'all or anything. I shouldn't have planned around a product that wasn't released.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-13T08:57:23-07:00","id":1139946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139793#post1139793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the delays!<br /> <br /> Part-time Gods or Godbound by Sine Nomine would be my suggestion.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can make it up to us with baked goods for all of us.<br /> <br /> But for real, isn't it partly out of your hands at this point anyway? I see Origins is in Art Direction on the meeting notes, which means after that it goes into layout and I assume Hero then will go into art direction when it is cleared out. Both of those are different dudes in OPP so it comes when it comes. I kind of hope to see it by Halloween time just because I love holiday coincidences but it'll get here when it gets here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T18:55:14-07:00","id":1143636,"title":"","content":"Legacy: Life Among The Ruins funded a bunch of setting hacks as part of the Kickstarter for the new edition and one of them is called Godsend. It's about playing gods and their avatars during the end times in a fantasy setting, and it see,s to be shaping up really well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T23:09:06-07:00","id":1144296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1143636#post1143636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Legacy: Life Among The Ruins funded a bunch of setting hacks as part of the Kickstarter for the new edition and one of them is called Godsend. It's about playing gods and their avatars during the end times in a fantasy setting, and it see,s to be shaping up really well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the suggestion Lex! Unfortunately this won't be available for my group as it won't be ready in time either, but it's still good to know for future reference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T23:14:46-07:00","id":1144297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alpharius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139946#post1139946\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But for real, isn't it partly out of your hands at this point anyway? I see Origins is in Art Direction on the meeting notes, which means after that it goes into layout and I assume Hero then will go into art direction when it is cleared out. Both of those are different dudes in OPP so it comes when it comes. I kind of hope to see it by Halloween time just because I love holiday coincidences but it'll get here when it gets here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh man, I sure hope that Hero has been in Art Direction too, and that it just wasn't listed separately since both entered that phase at the same time. Otherwise we're still at least 8 months out from a finished product since (last I heard) both were going to be released at the same time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T06:51:57-07:00","id":1144383,"title":"","content":"Hero and Origins have both been on the list in other stages separately. Probably the same here","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T07:33:40-07:00","id":1144399,"title":"","content":"Marvel RPG. Very easy (and a bit primitive), although useful and vestal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T05:24:54-07:00","id":1144713,"title":"","content":"although it would take some work. using the exalted modern setting from shards of the exalted dream (EX2nd ed) could work, although it is still storyteller.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-29T15:30:50-07:00","id":1145371,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1139610#post1139610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">City of Mist is a PbtA game about mythic superheroes that would be very easy to reskin as Scion.</div> </div> </div> </div>As an aside, the text of the book for this just went out to backers, and suggests &quot;gods incarnated into mortal form&quot; as a campaign frame. The rules are also a delight.<br /> <br /> Just saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-29T17:35:22-07:00","id":1145401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lashet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1144399#post1144399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Marvel RPG. Very easy (and a bit primitive), although useful and vestal.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll take a look, thanks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ahather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1144713#post1144713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">although it would take some work. using the exalted modern setting from shards of the exalted dream (EX2nd ed) could work, although it is still storyteller.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, not an impossible fit. That said, between some of the flaws in Exalted 2E and the work that would need to go into dummying it up to be more Scion-ish, I'd rather work with something else. Thanks for the suggestion though!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1145371#post1145371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As an aside, the text of the book for this just went out to backers, and suggests &quot;gods incarnated into mortal form&quot; as a campaign frame. The rules are also a delight.<br /> <br /> Just saying.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds interesting. That said, it would need to come out tomorrow for non-backers to be a reasonable choice at this point, as I'll be talking to players on Sunday about alternatives. Though the free preview looks interesting, I'm not going to commit to running a year and a half or so campaign on an incomplete document.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-31T21:46:47-07:00","id":1154613,"title":"","content":"City of Mist is now out and I honestly struggle to see myself using actual Scion over it. It\u2019s so good!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-31T22:18:27-07:00","id":1154621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1154613#post1154613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">City of Mist is now out and I honestly struggle to see myself using actual Scion over it. It\u2019s so good!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Have you actually played it? I've read it and it looks awesome but I'm curious as to whether the gameplay can live up to the book's intentions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-31T22:59:42-07:00","id":1154635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Squee</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1139598-playing-scion-with-non-scion-systems?p=1154621#post1154621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Have you actually played it? I've read it and it looks awesome but I'm curious as to whether the gameplay can live up to the book's intentions.</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven\u2019t yet, but the Lady Blackbird or Fate-inspired approach to stats over classic PbtA one is amazing, and I say that as someone who loves a lot of other PbtA games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"lin